OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal cigarettes and tobacco
OL,4,Aworth #15k seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized more than 11,000
OL,7,Fillegal cigarettes and #4,000 in cash
OL,8,Facross several retail sites during a
OL,9,Ftargeted operation.
OL,11,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,FConstabulary said it carried out the
OL,13,Fvisits to several shops on Fleet Road,
OL,14,Fin Fleet, on Wednesday.
OL,16,FIn total, the force said it had seized
OL,17,F11,180 cigarettes, with a street value
OL,18,Fof about #8,385, alongside 197 packets
OL,19,Fof hand rolling tobacco worth roughly
OL,20,F#6,895.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
