OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal cigarettes and tobacco
OL,4,Aworth #15k seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Terry Read, who coordinated the
OL,7,Faction, said it came after the force
OL,8,Fhad "listened to the community's
OL,9,Fconcerns" regarding illegal trading in
OL,10,Fthe area.
